  "notes": [
   "Laid out from the design's connections: Planetary set: Sun gear (30 teeth) on the Input shaft; 3 x Planet gear (30 teeth) on the radius a = 60 mm, each on its own Planet pin and Planet bearing, the pins fixed in the Planet carrier on the Output shaft; Ring gear (90 internal teeth, a = m (z_r - z_p) / 2) fixed in the Housing base against its -Y wall. Ring fixed, sun in, carrier out: i = 1 + z_r / z_s = 4. The input and output shafts are coaxial along +Y, each in two bearings in its end wall; the housing is sized for the ring (Ø197) and the stack."
  ],
